-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- No principal is seeded on purpose.
-- The very first service account is created at startup from harness.bootstrap.secret (see
-- PrincipalBootstrap). Shipping a migration with a known secret would leave every deployment
-- sharing the same credential until somebody remembers to rotate it - the failure mode we
-- already track for portal's reversible password column (01 §2.1 结论 B).
-- -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
